            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a galgame about love at college and animal girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Have you ever wondered why you don't have a girlfriend? Or whether you will get a girlfriend? Sometimes, people know one another on the spur of the moment, or it might be an act by a deity. Could anyone read a human's mind? What if the person is a deity? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Perhaps the fox spirit also has its own willful nature. Maybe it has always been straightforward.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yan is a college student with a special guardian girl named Mori at his side. &quot;If my girlfriend is as beautiful as Mori, then my life must be blessed by the gods...&quot; Unknowingly, another girl is entering his life... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D dynamic characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Well-drawn backgrounds and CGs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-dynamic scenes <br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mori</u></strong> <br>Mori is a fox spirit from a shrine in the mountains. She has been staying with Yan since he was a child. Sometimes, she is quiet like a refined lady. At other times, she is brisk like a rabbit. As a deity, could a human read her mind...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Liya</u></strong> <br>Liya is a girl who keeps a &quot;weapon&quot; on her at all times. She has a wealth of knowledge but lacks practical experience. Even with her collection of knowledge, one question still bothers her. Why is Yan &quot;blessed&quot; by a deity...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Yan</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college student who lives in a bookstore, often transcribing old texts. Make no mistake, he is the main character &quot;blessed&quot; by a deity... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English subtitles by MangAnimE and woosk from Visual novel, JRPG, Anime and partner website Sinical Network.[/List]</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a galgame about love at college and animal girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Have you ever wondered why you don't have a girlfriend? Or whether you will get a girlfriend? Sometimes, people know one another on the spur of the moment, or it might be an act by a deity. Could anyone read a human's mind? What if the person is a deity? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Perhaps the fox spirit also has its own willful nature. Maybe it has always been straightforward.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yan is a college student with a special guardian girl named Mori at his side. &quot;If my girlfriend is as beautiful as Mori, then my life must be blessed by the gods...&quot; Unknowingly, another girl is entering his life... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D dynamic characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Well-drawn backgrounds and CGs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-dynamic scenes <br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mori</u></strong> <br>Mori is a fox spirit from a shrine in the mountains. She has been staying with Yan since he was a child. Sometimes, she is quiet like a refined lady. At other times, she is brisk like a rabbit. As a deity, could a human read her mind...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Liya</u></strong> <br>Liya is a girl who keeps a &quot;weapon&quot; on her at all times. She has a wealth of knowledge but lacks practical experience. Even with her collection of knowledge, one question still bothers her. Why is Yan &quot;blessed&quot; by a deity...? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Yan</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college student who lives in a bookstore, often transcribing old texts. Make no mistake, he is the main character &quot;blessed&quot; by a deity... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English subtitles by MangAnimE and woosk from Visual novel, JRPG, Anime and partner website Sinical Network.[/List]</p>",
